Step 5:
   Updateing the image version in various step
  (without risky way)  
    * Step1: vi nginx-deployment.yml
    * Step2: now you can edit the image 
    * Step3: kubectl apply -f nginx-deployment.yml

   (It is very risky way and it is comming from direct etcd)
    * Step1: kubectl edit deployments.apps "deployment name"
    * step2: now you can update the image version
    * step3: after saving the deployment file automatically image version will be changed

   (This is the safest way)
      
